# AIHub line-ending policy.
#
# The project is authored with LF and deployed to Linux (Ubuntu 24.04) containers,
# where CRLF breaks shell scripts, the Dockerfile and the Caddyfile.
# Normalize text to LF in the repository and keep LF in every working copy.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary

# Container, proxy and systemd inputs must stay LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.timer text eol=lf

# Keep diffs readable in review tooling.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
